 well-being. True happiness, therefore, is not a constant state of joy but a dynamic balance of meaning, virtue, and connection. It arises not from external achievements alone but from how we relate to ourselves, others, and the world through intentional and ethical living. Ultimately, well-being is a philosophical and practical journey toward living a life of depth, authenticity, and compassion.", "encoded_message": "Such ideology about delight plus prosperity explores these attribute pertaining to his purposeful course along with when genuinely adds tending mankind flourishing. Earliest intellectuals including The thinker stipulated prosperity, a life passed throughout accordance together excellence as well as rationality, indicating how satisfaction stands without just happiness still deliberate undertaking. Throughout antithesis, up-to-date approaches usually link thriving to psychological states sort as favorable emotions, life satisfaction, and purposeful relationships. Scholars equivalent to The philosopher guided since joy derives by rudimentary joys with emancipation away from suffering, during Disciples urged hidden robustness in addition submission regarding whatever cannot happen regulated. Contemporary analysis regarding beneficial mental health backs these conceptions by demonstrating recognition, awareness, besides resilient interpersonal connections as key components of well-being. True happiness, therefore, is not a constant state of joy but a dynamic balance of meaning, virtue, and connection. It arises not from external achievements alone but from how we relate to ourselves, others, and the world through intentional and ethical living. Ultimately, well-being is a philosophical and practical journey toward living a life of depth, authenticity, and compassion.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 2.94, "secret_key_generation": 93.74}, "encoding_usage_report": {"container_generation": {"completion_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens": 111, "to